OL,3,A'Grief can colour memory': Palace
OL,4,Aresponds after Earl Spencer's claim in
OL,5,ADiana book
OL,6,
OL,7,FBuckingham Palace has responded after a
OL,8,Fclaim by Earl Spencer, the brother of
OL,9,FDiana, Princess of Wales, that King
OL,10,FCharles said "we'll forget her soon
OL,11,Fenough" days after her death.
OL,13,FEarl Spencer alleged the then-Prince of
OL,14,FWales subjected him to a "stream of
OL,15,Fanger" after he insisted Diana would
OL,16,Fnot have wanted Princes William and
OL,17,FHarry, then aged 15 and 12, to walk in
OL,18,Fher funeral procession.
OL,20,FThe claim was made in an extract from
OL,21,Fhis upcoming memoir, published by the
OL,22,FDaily Mail.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
