OL,3,AInterest rates hold expected but Bank
OL,4,Aof England facing tough choices
OL,5,
OL,6,FEconomists expect the MPC to hold the
OL,7,Fbenchmark Bank rate at 3.75% for a
OL,8,Fsixth consecutive meeting but analysts
OL,9,Fare more divided on whether the rate
OL,10,Fwill need to go up before the end of
OL,11,Fthe year.
OL,13,FThe Bank rate is crucial in setting the
OL,14,Fbenchmark for banks and other lenders
OL,15,Fin setting interest for individuals and
OL,16,Fbusinesses borrowing and saving money.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
